<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste said neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste said neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Melissa White started coverage of United Waste Systems Inc on Friday with a neutral rating, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- United Waste shares closed on Thursday at 36-4/16.</p>
<p>-- White later verified that she had inititated coverage of the company.</p>
</text>
